  "_about": [
    "Log Analytics table schemas for the Kusto-emulator harness (run.sh).",
    "learnColumns is the table's FULL column list (name -> Kusto type) as published on Microsoft Learn; the harness creates each table with ONLY the columns whose names appear in a lab/kql rule that reads the table (harness.py computes that set from the rule text on every run and writes the resulting .create table commands to the run record as setup.kql).",
    "A rule that reads a name its table does not have therefore fails to compile here, as it would in the workspace. A fixture row may carry any learnColumns name; names the harness table does not have are dropped (logged), names that are not Learn columns are refused.",
